{"_id":"RB64000000000016","name":"Защитный щит","type":"ability","img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-blue.webp","system":{"level":1,"category":"spell","description":"<p><strong>Rulebook 6.4 · Волшебник.</strong> 1 Вмешательство и 1 Волшебная сила; союзник в дистанции заклинаний.</p>","implementations":[{"id":"защитный-щит","name":"Защитный щит","description":"<p>Направленная защита союзника. При удалении урона удаляются два самых больших оставшихся куба; степень Эффекта снижается на 2.</p>","traitIds":["spell","intervention","defensive"],"costs":{"action":0,"movement":0,"intervention":0,"freeAction":false,"classResource":1,"additionalText":""},"targeting":{"mode":"none","relation":"any","countMin":0,"countMax":0,"rangeMode":"none","rangeCells":0,"requiresVisibility":false,"areaShape":"none","areaSize":"","text":""},"conditionText":"","requirementText":"","limitationText":"","exceptionText":"<p>Против Силового действия без проверки по Rulebook урон цели становится 0 без защитной проверки. Это специальное исключение пока исполняется вручную.</p>","check":{"enabled":false,"formula":"1d20 + {combatDie}","targetCharacteristic":"armor"},"defenseProcedure":{"directedDefense":false},"profiles":{},"outcomes":{"damage":{"enabled":false,"components":[]},"healing":{"enabled":false,"components":[]},"tempHp":{"enabled":false,"components":[]}},"actionParts":[],"defenseAction":{"enabled":true,"procedure":"directed","targetScope":"ally","interventionCost":1,"rangeMode":"manual","rangeCells":0,"requiresVisibility":false,"movementMode":"none","damageSelectionMode":"largest","combatDiceFormula":"","selfDefenseCharacteristic":"","removeDamageParts":2,"effectDegreeReduction":2,"allowManeuver":true},"effectUuids":[],"repeat":{"count":1,"label":"Результат"},"areas":[]}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":6000,"flags":{"fast-nri":{"rulebookEdition":"6.4","rulebookClass":"Волшебник","rulebookVerificationSet":"0.5.80.1","normativeSource":true,"verificationNote":"Исключение Силовой без проверки остаётся ручным в этом проверочном импорте."}}}
